<title>USA: Evans to purchase Triomphe Fourrures assets.</title>
<headline>Evans to purchase Triomphe Fourrures assets.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evans Inc, a furs and apparel retailer, said Wednesday it has signed a letter of intent to acquire assets of Triomphe Fourrures Inc from Revillon Inc.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The assets to be acquired are used in connection with the operation of the Maximillian Fur Salons in Bloomingdale's Stores, Evans said.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close in July, the company said.</p>
<p>Evan shares were unchanged at one Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
